  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T21:55:00.058978Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T06:13:28.938691Z",
  "totalBlocks": 44,
  "translatedBlocks": 44,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca3a36d33893ec1d",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴推出 Messages API，为 Text Generation Inference (TGI) 和 Inference Endpoints 提供 OpenAI 兼容性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9539c338f1fa61ce",
      "translationZh": "从 1.4.0 版本开始，TGI 提供了与 OpenAI Chat Completion API 兼容的 API。新的 Messages API 让客户和用户能够从 OpenAI 模型无缝转向开放的大语言模型。该 API 可以直接与 OpenAI 的客户端库或 LangChain、LlamaIndex 等第三方工具配合使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d34aba247b8c01fa",
      "translationZh": "“新的 Messages API 具备 OpenAI 兼容性，让 Ryght 的实时生成式 AI 编排平台能够轻松地将大语言模型用例从 OpenAI 切换到开放模型。我们毫不费力地从 GPT4 迁移到了 Inference Endpoints 上的 Mixtral/Llama2，现在我们的工作流程更加简化，对 AI 解决方案也拥有了更多控制权。”——Ryght 首席技术官 Johnny Crupi",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4c86f1f078efc22",
      "translationZh": "新的 Messages API 现已在 Inference Endpoints 中推出，专用和无服务器两种类型均可使用。为了帮助你快速上手，我们提供了详细示例，介绍如何：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "847754493697b4f1",
      "translationZh": "创建一个 Inference Endpoint",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00a3c39c02672d00",
      "translationZh": "将 Inference Endpoints 与 OpenAI 客户端库配合使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b87b659309e41cbf",
      "translationZh": "与 LangChain 和 LlamaIndex 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7e7d6fb86748aaa",
      "translationZh": "限制：Messages API 目前不支持函数调用，并且仅适用于在分词器配置中定义了 chat_template 的大语言模型，例如 Mixtral 8x7B Instruct。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "847754493697b4f1",
      "translationZh": "创建推理端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29136c79022aa277",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 提供安全的生产级解决方案，让你能够轻松地将 Hub 上的任意机器学习模型部署到由 Hugging Face 管理的专用基础设施上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "993d4a2681aea7c3",
      "translationZh": "在本示例中，我们将使用 Text Generation Inference，把经过微调的 Mixtral 模型 Nous-Hermes-2-Mixtral-8x7B-DPO 部署到 Inference Endpoints。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cded9ec11b77fe31",
      "translationZh": "我们只需在 UI 中点击几下即可部署模型，也可以利用 huggingface_hub Python 库，以编程方式创建和管理 Inference Endpoints。这里我们将演示如何使用 Hub 库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f4c8606ce372c6c",
      "translationZh": "在下方展示的 API 调用中，我们需要指定端点名称和模型仓库，以及 text-generation 任务。在本示例中，我们使用 protected 类型，因此访问已部署的端点需要有效的 Hugging Face 令牌。我们还需要配置硬件要求，例如供应商、区域、加速器、实例类型和规格。你可以使用此 API 调用查看可用资源选项列表，并在此处的目录中查看部分模型的推荐配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb223924a6b7b20c",
      "translationZh": "注意：你可能需要发送电子邮件至 api-enterprise@huggingface.co，申请提高配额。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a956668aa07e365d",
      "translationZh": "我们的部署需要几分钟才能启动。我们可以使用 .wait() 实用方法阻塞正在运行的线程，直到端点达到最终的 \"running\" 状态。端点运行后，我们可以确认其状态，并通过 UI Playground 试用一下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69174bde9aee3578",
      "translationZh": "太好了，我们现在有了一个可以正常工作的端点！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7bb228bfe13fe384",
      "translationZh": "💡 使用 huggingface_hub 部署时，为了优化非活跃期间的成本，你的端点默认会在空闲 15 分钟后缩容至零。请查阅 Hub Python Library 文档，了解可用于管理端点生命周期的全部功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "00a3c39c02672d00",
      "translationZh": "通过 OpenAI 客户端库使用 Inference Endpoints",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a6f778650d2a2f1",
      "translationZh": "TGI 对 Messages 的支持使 Inference Endpoints 能够直接兼容 OpenAI Chat Completion API。这意味着，任何现有的通过 OpenAI 客户端库使用 OpenAI 模型的脚本，都可以直接切换为使用在 TGI 端点上运行的任意开放 LLM！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4ad66bcf2f9241e",
      "translationZh": "通过这种无缝切换，你可以立即享受到开放模型带来的诸多优势：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93c4738bd1e78f8f",
      "translationZh": "对模型和数据拥有完全的控制权和透明度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b6ed949922e5ff13",
      "translationZh": "不再需要担心速率限制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44e521c9905feea1",
      "translationZh": "能够根据你的具体需求全面定制系统",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6014c35c1ceefaa",
      "translationZh": "让我们看看具体怎么做。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "57b80ec2751f601f",
      "translationZh": "使用 Python 客户端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c370eb47848d0516",
      "translationZh": "下面的示例展示了如何使用 OpenAI Python Library 完成这一迁移。只需将 <ENDPOINT_URL> 替换为你的端点 URL（务必包含 v1/ 后缀），并在 <HF_API_TOKEN> 字段中填入有效的 Hugging Face 用户令牌。你可以从 Inference Endpoints 界面获取 <ENDPOINT_URL>，也可以通过上文创建的端点对象的 endpoint.url 获取。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f09280d23e4bb5a",
      "translationZh": "接下来，我们就可以像往常一样使用客户端，传入消息列表，以流式方式接收来自 Inference Endpoint 的响应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5346259aedcdb4d6",
      "translationZh": "在后台，TGI 的 Messages API 会使用模型的聊天模板，自动将消息列表转换为模型所需的指令格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be1a884108c11578",
      "translationZh": "💡 某些 OpenAI 功能（例如函数调用）与 TGI 不兼容。目前，Messages API 支持以下聊天补全参数：stream、max_tokens、frequency_penalty、logprobs、seed、temperature 和 top_p。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fb992b6dd6a66446",
      "translationZh": "使用 JavaScript 客户端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bd8b9e163ff6fa6",
      "translationZh": "下面是与上文相同的流式响应示例，但使用的是 OpenAI Javascript/Typescript Library。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b87b659309e41cbf",
      "translationZh": "与 LangChain 和 LlamaIndex 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5877e2ea38961b2",
      "translationZh": "现在，让我们看看如何在你偏好的 RAG 框架中使用这个新创建的端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dad2288055c91b67",
      "translationZh": "如何在 LangChain 中使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f85751b348256d22",
      "translationZh": "要在 LangChain 中使用它，只需创建一个 ChatOpenAI 实例，并传入你的 <ENDPOINT_URL> 和 <HF_API_TOKEN>，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70ee79bdb1d90517",
      "translationZh": "我们可以直接使用与调用 OpenAI 模型时相同的 ChatOpenAI 类。这样，只需更改一行代码，之前的所有代码就都能与我们的端点配合使用。现在，让我们在一个简单的 RAG 流水线中使用以这种方式声明的 LLM，回答一个关于某篇 HF 博客文章内容的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "71c9ba4cca430a8a",
      "translationZh": "如何在 LlamaIndex 中使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee2b0337e428702f",
      "translationZh": "同样，你也可以在 LlamaIndex 中使用 TGI 端点。我们将使用 OpenAILike 类，并通过配置一些额外参数（即 is_local、is_function_calling_model、is_chat_model、context_window）来实例化它。请注意，上下文窗口参数应与先前为端点设置的 MAX_TOTAL_TOKENS 值一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5d55134c3be6610",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们可以在类似的 RAG 流水线中使用它。请记住，你之前在 Inference Endpoint 中选择的 MAX_INPUT_LENGTH 值，会直接影响模型能够处理的检索分块数量（similarity_top_k）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5fefb3cc0cd33a9a",
      "translationZh": "清理资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d47c4051c84fba29",
      "translationZh": "使用完端点后，你可以暂停或删除它。这一步可以通过 UI 完成，也可以通过如下方式以编程方式完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a748b506aaae4c06",
      "translationZh": "Text Generation Inference 中新增的 Messages API 提供了从 OpenAI 模型平滑迁移到开放 LLM 的路径。我们迫不及待地想看到，你会利用运行在 TGI 上的开放 LLM 实现哪些用例！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d835b73421de166",
      "translationZh": "本文所述代码的可运行版本，请参阅此 notebook。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
